{"id":"bob-potter","n":"Bob Potter","photo":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/images/headshots/bio_bob_potter.jpg","bio":"Bob owned and operated a Super Market for several years in Oklahoma City before joining the Navigators in 1962. At the age of 30 both he and his wife committed their lives to Christ at a Billy Graham Crusade in Oklahoma City. Bob and Evon have been married 63 years. During the past 43 years Bob has ministered in Military, Collegiate and Community ministries, and also served several years as Director of Public Relations at The Navigators headquarters. His passion...”To Know Christ and to Make Him Known.”","queue":["16396","29695","16553","13828","19310","29694","21559","29689","19323","10447","12769","19309","29691","19325","29693","8014","10021","27458","13827","29697","7446","21699","19322","26951","19324","29692","19326","19327","19311","29690","6750","29696"],"talks":{"29695":{"t":"Believing God, Having Faith","sp":"bob-potter","tp":["Faith","God, Characteristics of"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/T0187.mp3","lk":1},"16553":{"t":"Bible Study Techniques","sp":"bob-potter","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/APP00613.mp3","lk":0},"13828":{"t":"Building Men","sp":"bob-potter","tp":["Training","Discipleship"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/824B.mp3","lk":2},"19310":{"t":"Changing Job, Location, or Career","sp":"bob-potter","tp":["Business and Professional Life","Circumstances"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/D262.mp3","lk":0},"29694":{"t":"Changing Job, Location, or Career","sp":"bob-potter","tp":["Business and Professional Life","Circumstances"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/T0186.mp3","lk":4},"21559":{"t":"Counseling Class - Pete Sake","sp":"bob-potter","tp":[],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/DLS0216.mp3","lk":8},"29689":{"t":"Discipleship","sp":"bob-potter","tp":["Great Commission","Spiritual Multiplication"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/a